'''Paldean Wonders''' (Japanese: '''パルデアワンダー''' ''Paldea Wonder'') is the fourth {{TCGP|B Series}} expansion in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]].

== Information ==
'''Paldean Wonders''' is the second themed booster pack of the {{TCGP|B Series}} released through [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It focuses on Pokémon and characters from the [[Paldea]] region, including the [[Paldea first partner Pokémon]], {{p|Gholdengo}}, and more.

For the first time in Pokémon TCG Pocket, cards in this expansion reuse a wider range of artwork from the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]]; namely, from {{TCG|Pokémon ex}}, {{TCG|illustration rare card}}s, {{TCG|Supporter card}}s, and {{TCG|Stadium card}}s. All reused artwork in this set originates from cards with regulation mark {{reg|G}}, which had just {{TCG|rotation|rotated}} out of the {{TCG|Standard format}} in Japan a month prior to the release of Paldean Wonders.

